"Half damage.": "傷害減半。",
"Half damage only.": "僅受一半傷害。",
"If the {X} fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.": "若{X}豁免檢定失敗，它可以選擇改為成功。",
"The {X} can breathe air and water.": "{X}可以呼吸空氣與水。",
"The {X} can breathe only underwater.": "{X}只能在水下呼吸。",
"The {X} can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.": "{X}直到其下個回合開始前都無法再次執行此動作。",
"It repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.": "它在其每個回合結束時重複此豁免，成功時結束自身的效果。",
"The target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.": "目標在其每個回合結束時重複此豁免，成功時結束自身的效果。",
"After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.": "1 分鐘後，它自動成功。",
"The {X} makes one Rend attack.": "{X}進行一次撕裂攻擊。",
"The {X} moves up to half its {@variantrule Speed|XPHB}, and it makes one Rend attack.": "{X}移動至多其{@variantrule Speed|XPHB}的一半，並進行一次撕裂攻擊。",
"The {X} can move up to half its {@variantrule Speed|XPHB}, and it makes one Rend attack.": "{X}可以移動至多其{@variantrule Speed|XPHB}的一半，並進行一次撕裂攻擊。",
"The {X} has {@variantrule Advantage|XPHB} on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.": "{X}對法術與其他魔法效果的豁免檢定具有{@variantrule Advantage|XPHB}。",
"The {X} has {@variantrule Advantage|XPHB} on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the {X}'s allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn't have the {@condition Incapacitated|XPHB} condition.": "若{X}至少有一名盟友位於某生物 5 呎內，且該盟友未處於{@condition Incapacitated|XPHB}狀態，{X}對該生物的攻擊檢定具有{@variantrule Advantage|XPHB}。",
"The {X} can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.": "{X}可以攀爬困難的表面，包括沿著天花板移動，無需進行屬性檢定。",
"While in sunlight, the {X} has {@variantrule Disadvantage|XPHB} on ability checks and attack rolls.": "處於日光下時，{X}的屬性檢定與攻擊檢定具有{@variantrule Disadvantage|XPHB}。",
"The {X} doesn't provoke an {@action Opportunity Attack|XPHB} when it flies out of an enemy's reach.": "{X}飛離敵人的觸及範圍時不會引發{@action Opportunity Attack|XPHB}。",
", and the target has the {@condition Prone|XPHB} condition.": "，且目標處於{@condition Prone|XPHB}狀態。",
", and the target has the {@condition Poisoned|XPHB} condition until the end of its next turn.": "，且目標處於{@condition Poisoned|XPHB}狀態直到其下個回合結束。",
", and the target has the {@condition Deafened|XPHB} condition until the end of its next turn.": "，且目標處於{@condition Deafened|XPHB}狀態直到其下個回合結束。",
", and the target has the {@condition Poisoned|XPHB} condition until the start of the {X}'s next turn.": "，且目標處於{@condition Poisoned|XPHB}狀態直到{X}的下個回合開始。",
", and the target's {@variantrule Speed|XPHB} is halved until the end of its next turn.": "，且目標的{@variantrule Speed|XPHB}減半直到其下個回合結束。",
", and the target's {@variantrule Speed|XPHB} is 0 until the end of the target's next turn.": "，且目標的{@variantrule Speed|XPHB}降為 0 直到目標的下個回合結束。",
", and the target takes a -2 penalty to AC until the end of its next turn.": "，且目標的 AC 承受 -2 減值直到其下個回合結束。",
", and the target has {@variantrule Disadvantage|XPHB} on saving throws to maintain {@status Concentration|XPHB} until the end of its next turn.": "，且目標為維持{@status Concentration|XPHB}所進行的豁免檢定具有{@variantrule Disadvantage|XPHB}，直到其下個回合結束。",
", and the target is pushed up to 30 feet straight away from the {X}.": "，且目標被直線推離{X}至多 30 呎。",
", and the target is pushed up to 20 feet straight away from the {X} and has the {@condition Prone|XPHB} condition.": "，且目標被直線推離{X}至多 20 呎並處於{@condition Prone|XPHB}狀態。",
", and the target has the {@condition Incapacitated|XPHB} condition and is transported to a harmless demiplane until the start of the {X}'s next turn, at which point it reappears in an unoccupied space of the {X}'s choice within 120 feet of the {X}.": "，且目標處於{@condition Incapacitated|XPHB}狀態並被傳送到一個無害的半位面，直到{X}的下個回合開始，屆時它會重新出現在{X} 120 呎內一處由{X}選擇的未被佔據空間。",
", and the target has the {@condition Paralyzed|XPHB} condition until the start of the {X}'s next turn unless the target has {@variantrule Immunity|XPHB} to Cold damage.": "，且除非目標對寒冷傷害具有{@variantrule Immunity|XPHB}，否則它處於{@condition Paralyzed|XPHB}狀態直到{X}的下個回合開始。",
", or 9 ({@damage 3d4 + 2}) Slashing damage if the {X} moved 30+ feet straight toward the target immediately before the hit.": "；若{X}在命中前立即朝目標直線移動了 30 呎以上，則改為 9（{@damage 3d4 + 2}）揮砍傷害。"
}
